<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling weakens against dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling weakens against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling weakened against the dollar and pound in quiet trading, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The shilling traded at a mean average of 597.96 against the dollar, compared with Tuesday's 597.7719. Against the pound, the shilling traded at 965.1105, compared with 964.6275 on Tuesday.</p>
